A powerful concussive punch that deals [100%, 116%, 129%, 140%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage to your target. If the punch hits, all targets in a radius of 1 will take [35, 45, 53, 59, 65 (TL1-5; STR 100)] to [176, 227, 266, 297, 325 (TL1-5; STR 100)] damage, depending on the amount of combo points you've accumulated.

The area damage will scale with your Strength, and the radius will increase by 1 per combo point.

Using this talent removes your combo points.
